<div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_240px] md:items-start">
  <div class="prose-club">
    <p>For a one-off annual subscription of only <strong>£420</strong> you receive <strong>100 points</strong>. If you want to play more golf, simply buy more points.</p>
    <p>You can use <strong>80 points at Penn Golf Club</strong>, your home club, and <strong>20 points away</strong> at any other PlayMoreGolf partner club in the UK, including Celtic Manor, Carden Park and Wokefield Park.</p>
    <p>As a member you'll have your own online account where you can refer friends or buy more points, depending on how often you play. Booking couldn't be easier: select your course, date and time, and you're set. You can also use your points for up to three friends, which adds even more flexibility.</p>
